    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The experience of human life is an alternation of joy and suffering. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pareidolia is a psychological horror, where you can control your character from two perspectives, which imply artistic style and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684650/extras/67eaccfd9cb08d21276e1eb35cae53b7.poster.avif?t=1737929592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684650/extras/67eaccfd9cb08d21276e1eb35cae53b7.webm?t=1737929592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684650/extras/67eaccfd9cb08d21276e1eb35cae53b7.mp4?t=1737929592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a game about a game. You will live in and out of it, meet different creatures and choose whether to help them. It all reflects how you see things.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The experience of human life is an alternation of joy and suffering. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pareidolia is a psychological horror, where you can control your character from two perspectives, which imply artistic style and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684650/extras/67eaccfd9cb08d21276e1eb35cae53b7.poster.avif?t=1737929592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684650/extras/67eaccfd9cb08d21276e1eb35cae53b7.webm?t=1737929592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684650/extras/67eaccfd9cb08d21276e1eb35cae53b7.mp4?t=1737929592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a game about a game. You will live in and out of it, meet different creatures and choose whether to help them. It all reflects how you see things.</p>",
